# REGIONAL GAZETTE

# GUNUNGKIDUL REGENCY

# SPECIAL REGION OF YOGYAKARTA

(Official News of the Gunungkidul Regency Government) Number: 1 Year: 2020

# REGIONAL REGULATION OF GUNUNGKIDUL REGENCY NUMBER 1 OF 2020

# CONCERNING

IMPLEMENTATION OF PROTECTION FOR WOMEN AND CHILDREN FROM VIOLENCE

# BY THE GRACE OF GOD ALMIGHTY THE REGENT OF GUNUNGKIDUL,

Considering:  
a. that the implementation of protection for women and children victims of violence has been stipulated by Regional Regulation of Gunungkidul Regency Number 25 of 2012;  
b. that in accordance with social developments and in order to optimize the protection of women and children victims of violence, Regional Regulation Number 25 of 2012 needs to be amended and adjusted;  
c. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a and letter b, it is necessary to stipulate a Regional Regulation concerning the Implementation of Protection for Women and Children from Violence;  

In View of:  
1. Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;  

2. Law Number 15 of 1950 concerning the Establishment of Regency Regions within the Special Region of Yogyakarta (State Gazette of 1950 Number 44);  
3. Law Number 23 of 2014 concerning Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2014 Number 224, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5587) as amended, most recently by Law Number 9 of 2015 concerning the Second Amendment to Law Number 23 of 2014 (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2015 Number 58, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5679);  
4. Law Number 23 of 2002 concerning Child Protection (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2002 Number 109, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3143) as last amended by Law Number 17 of 2016 (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2016 Number 237, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5946);  
5. Law Number 23 of 2004 concerning the Elimination of Domestic Violence (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2004 Number 95, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4419);  

With Mutual Approval

# REGIONAL HOUSE OF REPRESENTATIVES

# GUNUNGKIDUL REGENCY

# REGENT OF GUNUNGKIDUL

# DECIDES:

To Stipulate: REGIONAL REGULATION CONCERNING THE IMPLEMENTATION OF PROTECTION

